# T23.SYNT — projeto que usa ontologia compartilhada externa.

TEMPLATE t23

SOURCE FIELDS
    REQUIRED description
END SOURCE FIELDS

ITEM FIELDS
    REQUIRED citation
    OPTIONAL code
END ITEM FIELDS

ONTOLOGY FIELDS
    REQUIRED definition, group
END ONTOLOGY FIELDS

FIELD description TYPE TEXT
    SCOPE SOURCE
END FIELD

FIELD definition TYPE TEXT
    SCOPE ONTOLOGY
END FIELD

FIELD group TYPE TEXT
    SCOPE ONTOLOGY
END FIELD

FIELD citation TYPE QUOTATION
    SCOPE ITEM
END FIELD

FIELD code TYPE CODE
    SCOPE ITEM
END FIELD
